<title>USA: AGTsports in $1.2 million debt swap.</title>
<headline>AGTsports in $1.2 million debt swap.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>AGTsports Inc said on Wednesday that it agreed with a major creditor on a $1.2 million debt-to-equity conversion.</p>
<p>The company also said that a $2.17 million lawsuit against it was dismissed.</p>
<p>It said the two events together will help with the continued restructuring of the company.</p>
</text>
